{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226540","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226540","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422654001:1":{"text":"色は違うが、フェリルが植えた花と似ている気がする……","source_cn":"斐利尔种下的花，与这里的颜色虽然不同，但感觉很相似。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC732BC47B9E58EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422654002:1":{"text":"おや若いの、お前さんも花が好きなのかい？","source_cn":"年轻人，你也喜欢花吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94A0B126A238D1A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422654003:1":{"text":"邪魔をしてすまない。ここの花は、あなたが植えたのか？少し近くで見てもいいだろうか。","source_cn":"打扰了，这花圃是你的吗？我没有恶意，只是想近看下这些美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC23555DCE4FCFF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422654004:1":{"text":"花を育てるのが好きな……友人がいるんだ。彼は、サロクディアで新種の花を栽培していた。","source_cn":"我有个朋友，也喜欢种花。他曾在萨洛克兰培育出一种新的花朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9940382AE30A36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1422654004":{"text":"花を育てるのが好きな……友人がいるんだ。彼は、サロクディアで新種の花を栽培していた。","source_cn":"我有个朋友，也喜欢种花。他曾在萨洛克兰培育出一种新的花朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9940382AE30A36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422654005:1":{"text":"ほお、そんな劣悪な環境で、よくもまあ綺麗な花を咲かせられたものだねえ。きっと、その子の綺麗な心に、花が影響されたんだろう。","source_cn":"在如此恶劣的环境下，却能孕育出美丽的花朵？那定是种花之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C028211454CB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422654006:1":{"text":"ああ、フェリルは……私の友人は、本当に花が好きなんだ。","source_cn":"是的，斐利尔……我是说我的朋友他，非常喜欢花朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58F9A4FD0DD5F111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422654007:1":{"text":"だが、我々の故郷は植物の生長に適しておらず、品種も乏しく、育てられる花は限られていた……","source_cn":"我们那里不太适宜植物生长，他也没什么机会接触不同的品种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF009B3AAEAF30BB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422654008:1":{"text":"それなら、わしの花畑からいくつか持っていくかね？どれも丹精込めて育てた唯一無二の子たちだ、お友だちも喜ぶぞ！","source_cn":"那样的话，要不要从我这里取些花草回去送给他？这些都是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE3D28DCA05003E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422654009:1":{"text":"この子たちは丈夫だから、どんな場所でも育つはずだ。しかも、見た目が綺麗なだけでなく、薬用や食用にもなる！","source_cn":"它们极为坚韧，无论何处都能茁壮成长。除了美丽，还有药用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B5BF0CE0B133E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422654010:1":{"text":"いや、彼は……もういないんだ。","source_cn":"他……已经不在了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC161B7D6B2DE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422654011:1":{"text":"そうだったのか、すまんな。そうとは知らず……","source_cn":"……这，抱歉啊！我不清楚这事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A092964A201A5CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422654012:1":{"text":"いや、気にしないでくれ。私も、ぜひここの花をサロクディアのみんなに見せてやりたいが、今回は急いで出てきたので、支払える物が何もないんだ……","source_cn":"无妨。我确实想带些回去，让萨洛克兰的人们见识一番。只是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41A40ED439FC154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422654013:1":{"text":"はははっ、いらんいらん！これも何かの縁だ。わしの育てた植物が異国の地で花開くなんて、これ以上喜ばしいことはないさ！","source_cn":"哈哈，不必如此！以花会友罢了。要是我培育的这些花能在他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D043C5D4792EDA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422654014:1":{"text":"しかし、これはあなたが大切に育てた花だ。ただでもらうわけには――","source_cn":"可，这是你精心培育的品种，我不能——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4633F868E81E6747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422654015:1":{"text":"わしは商人じゃなくて、ただの園芸家だからな。わしにとって一番大事なのは、金なんかじゃないのさ。","source_cn":"我不是通商的商人，只是个花匠，对我而言，最宝贵的东西从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694B9495D9E66F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422654016:1":{"text":"花を慈しみ、育む心と、他人がそこから得られる喜び――","source_cn":"爱着花朵，想要培育花朵的心，他人从花朵中得到的喜悦——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA189C459943AE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422654017:1":{"text":"太陽の光、月の光、雨風、そして動物たち……それらすべてが、かけがえのない宝なんだ。","source_cn":"阳光、月光、风雨，还有这些动物——这一切一切，才是无与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51114EB1B58C445","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422654018:1":{"text":"それに、明月樹のご加護があれば、これからも、もっとたくさんの花と出会えるはずだからな！","source_cn":"何况，在皎月树的守护下，我一定能培育出更多的花种！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4F3556738486B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422654019:1":{"text":"明月樹の加護とは？","source_cn":"皎月树的守护？那是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73867BDD06318E70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422654020:1":{"text":"お前さんの目の前に聳えるその大樹さ！周りにいる生き物を育んでくださる、守護の木だよ。","source_cn":"哈哈，就是你面前这颗起舞的大树。它是滋养周围生灵的守护之树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C07944ABCF7121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422654021:1":{"text":"わしの花畑も、明月樹の加護が及ぶ範囲にあるからな。だから、特別な品種を生み出すことができるのさ。","source_cn":"我的花圃就在皎月树的恩泽范围内，这也是我能培育出特别花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB45CA77DDCF685CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422654022:1":{"text":"なるほど。花を分けてくれてありがとう。大切に育てると約束するよ。","source_cn":"我明白了。谢谢你的花种，我会精心照料它的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A73D86FB4BB2F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422654023:1":{"text":"フェリルがここに来たら……きっと、心から喜んでいただろうな。","source_cn":"如果……斐利尔还在，来到这里，他一定会非常幸福吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A19943D1D06674D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"（インドラと一緒に、フェリルが植えた花について説明する）","source_cn":"（跟因度厄一起描述斐利尔种下的花）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D0C33D814C554AE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（インドラと一緒に、フェリルが植えた花について説明する）","female":"（インドラと一緒に、フェリルが植えた花について説明する）","variant_male_record_index":"72972","variant_female_record_index":"72973","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title